id: atmospheric-bubble
name: Atmospheric Bubble
uaType: magical
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
tpCost: 10
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerBaseTier: 4
# "While this Unique Ability's effects are applied" - applied when used, and kept by paying its Ki Point Cost at
# the start of each of your turns (chat.mjs upkeepUniques: paid on its own, a Stop on the card - the user's).
sustained: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Applied, you ignore the rules for Unbreathable Environments; its KP paid again at the start of each of your
  turns, or it stops.
text: >
  Atmospheric Bubble: You create a shield around you that provides fresh air for you, regardless of the conditions
  outside.
  –Ability Type: Magical
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
  –TP Cost: 10
  –KP Cost: 4(bT)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Ignore the rules for Unbreathable Environments while this Unique Ability’s effects are applied.

  At the start of each of your turns, pay the Ki Point Cost for this Unique Ability or stop applying its effects.

---

# "Ignore the rules for Unbreathable Environments while this Unique Ability's effects are applied." `$applied`
# is 1 while they are (unique.mjs uniqueScriptOf).
[passive]
if ($applied == 1) {
  forbid unbreathableEnvironments;
}
